Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.96,0:03:06.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and yeah I just try to try to focus on my job
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.96,0:03:06.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就是专注做自己的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.32,0:03:09.12,EN,,0,0,0,,and play my game you know play
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.32,0:03:09.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,打我自己的球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.12,0:03:14.08,EN,,0,0,0,,with play like what I can do and test him
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.12,0:03:14.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,用我会的东西去试他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.08,0:03:15.76,EN,,0,0,0,,in everywhere with my slice
