Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.76,0:03:18.00,EN,,0,0,0,,with my you know go in return
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.76,0:03:18.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,用接发抢上去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:19.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and then push him back
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:19.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,把他往后逼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.52,0:03:21.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and it's really worked for me Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.52,0:03:21.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一套真的奏效了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.84,0:03:23.60,EN,,0,0,0,,How would you describe
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.84,0:03:23.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,对那些从没看过你打球
