Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.76,0:03:27.20,EN,,0,0,0,,never heard of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.76,0:03:27.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,你会怎么介绍自己
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.20,0:03:29.28,EN,,0,0,0,,who you are, what your life story
