Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.28,0:03:32.40,EN,,0,0,0,,is, and what type of game you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.28,0:03:32.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,以及你是什么打法？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.40,0:03:34.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Actually my idol is like Andy Murray.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.40,0:03:34.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的偶像是穆雷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:37.20,EN,,0,0,0,,I like to play like him as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:37.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也想打成他那样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.20,0:03:41.12,EN,,0,0,0,,And I I practice like a few years in the Spain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.20,0:03:41.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在西班牙练过几年
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.12,0:03:44.56,EN,,0,0,0,,So my games live like a Spanish style,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.12,0:03:44.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我的球偏西班牙风格
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.56,0:03:47.28,EN,,0,0,0,,like you know, play very heavy like top spin.
