Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.28,0:03:50.24,EN,,0,0,0,,And then and and this few years I try
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.28,0:03:50.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,这几年我在试着
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.24,0:03:52.56,EN,,0,0,0,,to change a bit you know
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.24,0:03:52.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,做一些改变
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.56,0:03:55.36,EN,,0,0,0,,because I I feel I need
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.56,0:03:55.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我感觉自己需要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.36,0:03:56.48,EN,,0,0,0,,to improve something
