Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.48,0:03:58.72,EN,,0,0,0,,and to get more higher ranking high level.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.48,0:03:58.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,才能打到更高的排名
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.72,0:04:00.88,EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah I try to play more aggressive now
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.72,0:04:00.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以现在我打得更主动
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:04.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and then get have I think I have good serve
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:04.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得我发球不错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.00,0:04:07.12,EN,,0,0,0,,and in the baseline I can I can defense I
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.00,0:04:07.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,底线能防守
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:09.20,EN,,0,0,0,,can run and then I can go to a net.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:09.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,能跑动 也能上网
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.20,0:04:10.48,EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.20,0:04:10.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.48,0:04:13.76,EN,,0,0,0,,a lot of people have ambitions
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.48,0:04:13.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,很多人都有野心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.76,0:04:15.52,EN,,0,0,0,,that are dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.76,0:04:15.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,也有梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.52,0:04:17.52,EN,,0,0,0,,What were your tennis dreams
