Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:41.12,EN,,0,0,0,,So when I was young you know
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:41.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我小的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.12,0:04:44.48,EN,,0,0,0,,the the people around me the the all
