Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.96,0:04:50.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,而这两三年我们已经有四个了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:53.76,EN,,0,0,0,,So of course we have a new goal right now
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:53.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以现在我们有了新目标
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.76,0:04:56.56,EN,,0,0,0,,but this is the break top 100 is like when I
