Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:05:00.80,EN,,0,0,0,,was junior to start a professional like player
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:05:00.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,从青少年转职业那会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.80,0:05:02.00,EN,,0,0,0,,is the my main goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.80,0:05:02.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是我最大的目标
