Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.80,0:06:43.68,EN,,0,0,0,,We have that tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.80,0:06:43.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,就有那种比赛了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.68,0:06:44.96,EN,,0,0,0,,We have that like match
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.68,0:06:44.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,有那种对抗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:47.12,EN,,0,0,0,,when when we are in the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:47.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,小孩子之间的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.12,0:06:50.24,EN,,0,0,0,,And then when I grew up a bit, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.12,0:06:50.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,等我长大一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.24,0:06:52.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I started play real tennis like
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.24,0:06:52.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,才开始打真正的网球
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.16,0:06:54.48,EN,,0,0,0,,when I was maybe eight and a half or nine,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.16,0:06:54.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,大概八岁半或者九岁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.48,0:06:55.52,EN,,0,0,0,,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.48,0:06:55.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.52,0:06:57.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Were you influenced by Li Na?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.52,0:06:57.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,你受过李娜的影响吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.68,0:06:59.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.68,0:06:59.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.36,0:07:01.36,EN,,0,0,0,,How important has she been?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.36,0:07:01.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,她对你有多重要？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.36,0:07:02.64,EN,,0,0,0,,For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.36,0:07:02.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,肯定有影响
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:06.96,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean the first Grand Slam winner Chinese
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:06.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,中国第一个大满贯冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.96,0:07:09.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and I think when we are young
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.96,0:07:09.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想我们小的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.60,0:07:10.88,EN,,0,0,0,,when probably when shooting
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.60,0:07:10.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,大概她拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.88,0:07:13.04,EN,,0,0,0,,the grand slam I just maybe 10 years old
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.88,0:07:13.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,大满贯那会儿 我大概十岁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:13.92,EN,,0,0,0,,or more or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:13.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,差不多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.92,0:07:16.00,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure which year is it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.92,0:07:16.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,具体哪一年我记不清了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.00,0:07:18.08,EN,,0,0,0,,and you know every everybody want
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.00,0:07:18.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,反正每个人都想
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.08,0:07:18.80,EN,,0,0,0,,to be like her
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.08,0:07:18.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,成为她那样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.80,0:07:20.16,EN,,0,0,0,,but you know in the men's side
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.80,0:07:20.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,但在男子这边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.16,0:07:21.76,EN,,0,0,0,,but we don't have top 100 players
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.16,0:07:21.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们连前一百的球员都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.76,0:07:24.48,EN,,0,0,0,,so you know it's little bit different we
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.76,0:07:24.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以有点不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:27.20,EN,,0,0,0,,have a lot great player in women's side
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:27.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,女子那边有很多好球员
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.20,0:07:30.48,EN,,0,0,0,,but in men's side is not that much
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.20,0:07:30.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,男子这边就没那么多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.48,0:07:31.28,EN,,0,0,0,,last question
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.48,0:07:31.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:33.12,EN,,0,0,0,,yeah your next match you're playing I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:33.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你下一场的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.12,0:07:34.72,EN,,0,0,0,,know if you know you're playing yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.12,0:07:34.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,不知道你清不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.72,0:07:36.16,EN,,0,0,0,,you played him a few years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.72,0:07:36.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你几年前跟他打过
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.16,0:07:38.08,EN,,0,0,0,,in a challenger do you do you remember
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.16,0:07:38.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,在一站挑战赛上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.08,0:07:39.76,EN,,0,0,0,,that match and yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.08,0:07:39.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,那场球你还记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.76,0:07:41.44,EN,,0,0,0,,actually not that much
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.76,0:07:41.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,其实记得不太清了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.44,0:07:42.40,EN,,0,0,0,,because I practiced him
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.44,0:07:42.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我今年
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:45.28,EN,,0,0,0,,in Cincinnati this year and in Wimbledon
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:45.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,在辛辛那提和温网
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:47.04,EN,,0,0,0,,and in the grass season as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:47.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有草地赛季都和他练过
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.04,0:07:48.96,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean he he he changed a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.04,0:07:48.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,他变了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.96,0:07:51.44,EN,,0,0,0,,and he play very great tennis right now
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.96,0:07:51.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在打得非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.44,0:07:53.76,EN,,0,0,0,,is much more different than two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.44,0:07:53.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,和两年前完全不一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.76,0:07:56.30,EN,,0,0,0,,So I would not look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.76,0:07:56.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我不会往回看
